{"seq":3,"slug":"impacts-projections","title":"影响与预测","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-change-basics/impacts-projections","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ipcc-scenarios","title":"IPCC情景路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-change-basics/impacts-projections/ipcc-scenarios","wordCount":2303,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"physical-impacts","title":"物理影响","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-change-basics/impacts-projections/physical-impacts","wordCount":2635,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"socioeconomic-impacts","title":"社会经济影响","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/climate-change-basics/impacts-projections/socioeconomic-impacts","wordCount":2765,"readingTime":12}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"影响与预测\">影响与预测</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>本章基于 IPCC 第六次评估报告（AR6）及最新全球盘点结果，系统梳理气候变化的物理影响和社会经济后果。从情景路径设定到具体影响评估，建立对气候风险的量化认知。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>序号</th>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>IPCC情景路径</td>\n<td>SSP1-5、RCP、AR6关键结论、碳中和时间线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>物理影响</td>\n<td>海平面上升、极端天气、冰盖融化、生态系统迁移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>社会经济影响</td>\n<td>粮食安全、水资源、经济损失、气候不平等</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关键概念\">关键概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>SSP（共享社会经济路径）</strong>：描述不同社会发展模式下的排放与适应能力</li>\n<li><strong>RCP（代表性浓度路径）</strong>：不同辐射强迫情景下的温室气体浓度轨迹</li>\n<li><strong>全球盘点（Global Stocktake）</strong>：巴黎协定下每五年一次的集体进展评估</li>\n</ul>\n"}